      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;In this talk at least the following questions should get a decent answer:&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; What happened since Etch and what will hopefully happen before Lenny?&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt; What is the Release schedule?&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt; What are the Release Goals?&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt; What does still need to happen?&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt; How can I help?&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA; </abstract>
